{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2024-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1719792000, "end_date": 1720396799, "month_true_total": 198, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:53:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "169285955", "author": {"steamid": "76561199094686047", "personaname": "⛧SarahMaisBrebis⛧", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SarahSheep/", "num_games_owned": 126, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 4523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4523, "last_played": 1719054051, "avatar": "9a5f247d5641b6cfe4a30c59da33e036175847dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gunfire Reborn is an excellent game that supports up to 3 other people. The game play is quite fun, with you getting stronger throughout your play through. While most rouge-like games can be quite tiresome to play, the difficulty you can create not only makes each run more unique, but also provides more (and better) loot, which in turn makes the game more fun than before. This is not mentioning simply playing the game with friends, which although can decrease the difficulty (even if the game tries to adjust with scaling to the player count), still remains as a fun game to run though. additionally, the dlc's, while being quite overpowered, are another fun addition to the game without being to expensive. all in all, Gunfire is an amazing game which is only improved with friends!", "timestamp_created": 1720394295, "timestamp_updated": 1720394295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "169279220", "author": {"steamid": "76561199006567356", "personaname": "Patrick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pjolah/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 20753, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12908, "deck_playtime_at_review": 59, "last_played": 1776574094, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is endlessly replayable to me atleast, like yeah the talent tree is busted and some of the harder lvs feel impossible without every talent but after that the entire game is about seeing how hard you can break the game and theres a lot of interesting ways of doing it. this is one of my favorite games of all time after learning everything and my friends seem to enjoy it when i make them read scrolls before pickng them up and sharing a few of my scrolls with them along the way", "timestamp_created": 1720387673, "timestamp_updated": 1720387673, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169245942", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096011488", "personaname": "Beutings", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/baconator3000/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 22398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21146, "last_played": 1728076832, "avatar": "5ad733d29046ce5b5c169ff14a61874798a4339c"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's pretty gud", "timestamp_created": 1720363607, "timestamp_updated": 1720363607, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202